WEBVTT

00:00:08.110 --> 00:00:14.300
Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:22.680
aoku nemuru mizu no hoshi ni sotto

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:22.680
Kissing softly the star of water that sleeps in blue,

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:31.410
kuchizuke shite inochi no hi wo tomosu hito yo

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:31.410
A person who lights the fire of life,

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:36.300
toki to iu kin'iro no sazanami wa

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:36.300
The time, the golden ripple,

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:45.070
oozora no kuchibiru ni umareta toiki ne

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:45.070
is a sigh from the lips of the sky,

00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:49.300
kokoro ni uzumoreta

00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:49.300
The stars of kindness...

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:52.270
yasashisa no hoshitachi ga

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:52.270
...buried in heart flame up...

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:56.440
honoo age yobiau

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:56.440
...and call to each other,

00:00:56.440 --> 00:01:03.430
namima sasurau nanpasen no you ni

00:00:56.440 --> 00:01:03.430
Like wrecked ships wandering on the waves...

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:08.870
mou nakanaide ima

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:08.870
Don't cry, any more,

00:01:08.870 --> 00:01:16.240
anata wo sagashite iru hito ga iru kara

00:01:08.870 --> 00:01:16.240
because now there is a person looking for you,

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:20.970
omae ni aitai yo to

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:20.970
Dying to see you...

00:01:37.580 --> 00:01:42.780
After leaving the Argama, Rosamia
Badam headed for Gryps 2 airspace.

00:01:45.060 --> 00:01:48.030
The Colony Laser at Gryps 2...

00:01:48.090 --> 00:01:52.620
...was nearly within range of
the Moon's surface city, Granada.

00:02:10.420 --> 00:02:15.110
To find a way out of this situation,
Granada's Melanie Hue Carbine...

00:02:15.550 --> 00:02:18.040
...sent a special envoy to the Argama.

00:02:19.540 --> 00:02:24.450
Haman's Victory

00:02:40.780 --> 00:02:42.510
- Take Haro away!
- Okay!

00:02:42.580 --> 00:02:45.380
- All because you brought it here, Qum!
- You rascals.

00:02:45.450 --> 00:02:48.280
Huh? You're here
without permission again?

00:02:48.350 --> 00:02:50.410
I'm accompanying Captain Henken.

00:02:52.790 --> 00:02:55.660
Captain Bright would like to see you
at the bridge.

00:02:55.730 --> 00:02:57.350
- See me?
- Yes.

00:02:57.900 --> 00:02:59.420
What a drag.

00:02:59.760 --> 00:03:02.030
We have received written orders
from Granada.

00:03:02.970 --> 00:03:04.730
- From Granada?
- Yes.

00:03:04.800 --> 00:03:06.100
All right, I'll go.

00:03:08.010 --> 00:03:09.700
What's the matter with Kamille?

00:03:10.310 --> 00:03:13.110
Something happened with
an enemy Cyber-Newtype.

00:03:18.520 --> 00:03:22.950
"Contact Haman Karn and request
that they destroy Gryps 2."

00:03:23.660 --> 00:03:25.090
What's this supposed to mean?!

00:03:25.160 --> 00:03:28.610
Just as it's written. Chairman Melanie
intends to do whatever it takes...

00:03:28.690 --> 00:03:30.630
...to bring Axis onto the side of
the A.E.U.G..

00:03:31.300 --> 00:03:33.290
But Haman's Axis is the A.E.U.G.'s enemy!

00:03:34.200 --> 00:03:36.760
We don't know if they
are our enemy yet.

00:03:36.840 --> 00:03:37.800
Lieutenant!

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:40.560
Do you agree
with this operation, Lieutenant?

00:03:42.510 --> 00:03:43.940
I do believe it's worth a try.

00:03:44.910 --> 00:03:46.570
Let's not do this!

00:03:46.640 --> 00:03:47.510
Katz!

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:50.140
This isn't up to you to decide!

00:03:50.420 --> 00:03:51.380
Yes, sir.

00:03:52.180 --> 00:03:55.150
Please tell Chairman Melanie
that we comply.

00:03:56.090 --> 00:03:58.350
We're counting on you.

00:04:13.170 --> 00:04:14.140
Kamille!

00:04:15.510 --> 00:04:16.500
Where's Lieutenant Quattro?

00:04:16.570 --> 00:04:19.510
- Right. The Lieutenant is...!
- Kamille! Kamille!

00:04:22.950 --> 00:04:24.510
You can't follow orders?!

00:04:24.820 --> 00:04:27.480
Do you two have any idea
what you're saying?!

00:04:27.550 --> 00:04:29.750
- Emma! Mad!
- It sure sounds that way.

00:04:29.820 --> 00:04:31.620
This is unacceptable!

00:04:32.490 --> 00:04:34.920
It's crooked to ask them
to act as a traitor.

00:04:34.990 --> 00:04:38.520
That's no different from the Titans,
who think nothing of using poison gas.

00:04:39.230 --> 00:04:42.200
Besides, who knows when Axis
might turn against us again?

00:04:42.470 --> 00:04:44.870
I couldn't bear being shot
from behind by the Gwadan.

00:04:45.000 --> 00:04:48.340
No one would shoot at
a mobile suit carrying a white flag!

00:04:48.410 --> 00:04:50.030
That's not what I'm saying!

00:04:50.810 --> 00:04:52.370
Captain Bright.

00:04:52.810 --> 00:04:54.800
Fa, are you of the same opinion as Katz?

00:04:55.180 --> 00:04:57.010
- Yes!
- I see.

00:04:57.080 --> 00:05:00.640
Then you two are to remain in the brig
until this operation is over.

00:05:00.890 --> 00:05:02.010
But why?!

00:05:02.090 --> 00:05:05.150
Ask yourself that question!
To the brig, now!

00:05:05.760 --> 00:05:08.190
The A.E.U.G.'s just like the army
of the old days.

00:05:08.260 --> 00:05:09.230
Katz!

00:05:09.860 --> 00:05:12.020
Katz! Proceeding to the brig, sir!

00:05:17.270 --> 00:05:19.130
Shinta! Qum! Where are your manners?!

00:05:22.070 --> 00:05:26.480
Well, they're not the only ones
against this upcoming operation.

00:05:26.540 --> 00:05:29.340
But if they go about
yelling that they're against it...

00:05:29.410 --> 00:05:31.380
...it'll affect the crew's morale!

00:05:31.720 --> 00:05:32.680
Yes.

00:05:33.950 --> 00:05:36.580
All this because we're
negotiating with Haman Karn?

00:05:36.790 --> 00:05:37.760
That's right.

00:05:37.990 --> 00:05:39.550
Depending on how negotiations go...

00:05:39.620 --> 00:05:41.590
...who knows what could happen
to the Argama.

00:05:41.960 --> 00:05:44.930
Lieutenant Emma, I'll go to the Gwadan.

00:05:45.430 --> 00:05:47.760
But you're against this upcoming operation
as well, aren't you?

00:05:48.400 --> 00:05:52.500
An order is an order,
and I actually find this operation...

00:05:52.570 --> 00:05:54.130
...somewhat interesting.

00:05:54.210 --> 00:05:55.170
Kamille.

00:05:55.710 --> 00:05:57.940
He seems to have settled down.

00:05:58.010 --> 00:06:00.640
Katz and Fa, on the other hand...!

00:06:01.810 --> 00:06:04.580
Shinta! Qum!
Get out! This is no playroom!

00:06:05.180 --> 00:06:07.910
- It's all right!
- We're going to stay here with Fa!

00:06:07.990 --> 00:06:10.780
Just watch out for the ghosts in there!

00:06:10.860 --> 00:06:12.980
There are no ghosts in outer space!

00:06:43.720 --> 00:06:45.780
The mobile suit is carrying a white flag.

00:06:46.260 --> 00:06:48.020
- It's alone, is it?!
- Yes, ma'am!

00:06:48.090 --> 00:06:49.460
I'm confirming signal flares!

00:06:50.090 --> 00:06:52.120
- Can you get an image?!
- Yes!

00:06:52.200 --> 00:06:53.930
This is the largest image we can get!

00:06:57.500 --> 00:06:59.130
Okay, switch on the guide beacons!

00:07:08.210 --> 00:07:09.180
Good!

00:07:23.730 --> 00:07:25.360
Typical of... the Zabi Family.

00:07:35.040 --> 00:07:36.770
I understand.

00:07:36.840 --> 00:07:40.780
But there's no need for you to send
a delegation over to the Gwadan.

00:07:40.850 --> 00:07:43.870
I will visit the Argama myself
to hear your request.

00:07:43.950 --> 00:07:45.970
Huh? You will?

00:07:47.490 --> 00:07:49.720
I am not that arrogant a person.

00:07:50.090 --> 00:07:51.720
I'll return respect for respect.

00:07:52.260 --> 00:07:53.380
Very well.

00:07:53.460 --> 00:07:55.720
Then I'll be waiting for you on the deck.

00:07:57.600 --> 00:07:58.790
Miss Haman.

00:07:58.860 --> 00:08:00.130
Are you sure about this?

00:08:00.200 --> 00:08:02.000
I'd like to see the inside of the Argama.

00:08:02.070 --> 00:08:03.360
Get the Qubeley ready.

00:08:03.430 --> 00:08:04.400
Yes, ma'am!

00:08:06.040 --> 00:08:07.800
Char Aznable.

00:08:07.870 --> 00:08:09.740
I didn't expect him to make this
kind of move.

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:45.100
So that's Haman Karn's mobile suit!

00:08:47.810 --> 00:08:51.080
- Is it Haman?!
- The Qubeley!

00:08:51.150 --> 00:08:53.120
They've even completed that one?

00:08:53.890 --> 00:08:56.820
The production capabilities of Axis
have improved greatly.

00:09:15.270 --> 00:09:17.900
So we meet again after Colony 13, Char.

00:09:18.280 --> 00:09:20.240
I don't believe our encounters
are a mere coincidence.

00:09:21.350 --> 00:09:24.310
Our relationship might last forever.
That's not a bad thing.

00:09:24.980 --> 00:09:26.310
Good answer.

00:09:26.380 --> 00:09:30.450
So I take it the A.E.U.G. accepts the revival
of the Zabi Family...

00:09:30.520 --> 00:09:32.580
...the previous rulers of the Space Colonies.

00:09:33.360 --> 00:09:34.320
Captain?

00:09:34.560 --> 00:09:38.090
The people supporting the A.E.U.G.
are willing to accept those conditions.

00:09:38.160 --> 00:09:41.150
If we hadn't accepted the Zabi Family's
revival, what would you have done?

00:09:41.730 --> 00:09:44.720
Simply stage an all out nuclear attack
against Earth.

00:09:45.200 --> 00:09:46.830
Axis is prepared to do as much.

00:09:47.940 --> 00:09:50.700
<i>If Earth is polluted any further,</i>
<i>it will...!</i>

00:09:51.180 --> 00:09:54.370
Here's the personal letter from
Melanie Carbine.

00:09:55.450 --> 00:09:56.410
I see.

00:09:56.550 --> 00:09:58.710
So they'll hand Side 3 over to us.

00:09:58.780 --> 00:10:00.650
And what do you want us to do?

00:10:01.220 --> 00:10:03.480
We'd like to have the Gwadan...

00:10:03.550 --> 00:10:05.490
...destroy the Gryps 2 Colony Laser.

00:10:07.990 --> 00:10:11.050
I'm overwhelmed to receive such a request
from Char himself.

00:10:11.530 --> 00:10:13.360
However, there's a problem.

00:10:13.700 --> 00:10:15.890
You don't know how to make a request.

00:10:27.250 --> 00:10:31.110
Please, Haman Karn.
Please destroy the Colony Laser.

00:10:35.220 --> 00:10:36.780
I will keep my promise.

00:10:36.850 --> 00:10:39.350
The proof of our might will forever
be etched in your minds!

00:10:44.430 --> 00:10:46.900
If that'll get things done, I can live with that.

00:10:49.800 --> 00:10:50.490
Lieutenant.

00:10:50.570 --> 00:10:51.760
Don't worry about it.

00:10:51.840 --> 00:10:54.330
We'll coordinate ourselves to the
movement of the Gwadan...

00:10:54.410 --> 00:10:57.400
...and stage a feint operation against
the Titans' fleet!

00:10:57.780 --> 00:10:59.570
We're sending out all mobile suits!

00:10:59.780 --> 00:11:00.740
Yes, sir!

00:11:12.320 --> 00:11:14.520
What? Only two vessels?

00:11:14.690 --> 00:11:16.750
Yes, we believe they belong to
the A.E.U.G..

00:11:17.430 --> 00:11:20.090
Certainly brave of them to chase after us...

00:11:20.300 --> 00:11:23.060
...but with only two vessels?

00:11:36.750 --> 00:11:37.770
Kamille.

00:11:38.580 --> 00:11:40.110
Have we caught up with Gryps?

00:11:41.150 --> 00:11:41.950
Yeah.

00:11:42.020 --> 00:11:43.950
Make sure Shinta and Qum wear suits
as well.

00:11:45.160 --> 00:11:46.920
I'll keep the door unlocked.

00:11:46.990 --> 00:11:49.430
Do as you wish,
but we're still not going to fight.

00:11:50.160 --> 00:11:52.060
What if you're stuck here unable to escape?!

00:11:52.130 --> 00:11:54.100
I don't want Shinta and Qum paying for it!

00:11:54.170 --> 00:11:56.330
- Kamille! Hurry!
- Right!

00:12:14.320 --> 00:12:15.880
You want to go, don't you, Fa?

00:12:16.850 --> 00:12:18.190
What about yourself?

00:12:18.260 --> 00:12:21.350
I'm not leaving here until I receive
permission from Captain Bright!

00:12:21.430 --> 00:12:22.950
That's obvious, isn't it?

00:12:29.700 --> 00:12:31.330
Rick Dias team, taking off!

00:12:34.670 --> 00:12:36.770
Gundam Mk. II! Emma, taking off!

00:12:40.240 --> 00:12:42.410
Zeta Gundam. Kamille, let's do it!

00:13:05.940 --> 00:13:09.340
The Gwadan's approaching Gryps 2,
according to plan, is it?

00:13:09.410 --> 00:13:11.710
Yes, they appear to be cooperating with us.

00:13:14.650 --> 00:13:17.210
Lieutenant, the Gwadan
has started to move, according to plan.

00:13:18.680 --> 00:13:20.120
We're not out of the woods yet.

00:13:20.180 --> 00:13:22.120
The big question is from this point on.

00:13:22.890 --> 00:13:25.080
Should the Gwadan decide to betray us...!

00:13:25.160 --> 00:13:27.350
The Argama and Radish will surely sink.

00:13:27.430 --> 00:13:29.150
Surely.

00:13:29.230 --> 00:13:32.160
Captain, I'd like to launch as well
on the Hyaku Shiki.

00:13:32.230 --> 00:13:34.290
No, I'd rather you remain here today.

00:13:38.440 --> 00:13:40.200
Our objective is not to fight.

00:13:40.270 --> 00:13:42.830
It's to lure the enemy away
as far as possible!

00:13:42.910 --> 00:13:44.240
Got that?!

00:13:44.710 --> 00:13:45.680
Roger!

00:13:49.580 --> 00:13:52.550
Zeta Gundam, Rick Dias team,
you're to charge at the enemy with me!

00:13:52.980 --> 00:13:55.710
Nemo team, spread out and be ready
for our second wave attack!

00:13:56.420 --> 00:13:57.940
Roger, Lieutenant Emma.

00:13:58.390 --> 00:13:59.360
They're here!

00:14:07.230 --> 00:14:08.530
It's begun.

00:14:09.030 --> 00:14:12.060
The A.U.E.G. is drawing out the enemy.

00:14:12.540 --> 00:14:15.970
So Bask is playing right into
the A.E.U.G.'s hands.

00:14:16.040 --> 00:14:17.630
What an incompetent man.

00:14:18.640 --> 00:14:20.080
We'll contact the Dogosse Gier.

00:14:20.140 --> 00:14:21.700
What's the density of Minovsky particles?

00:14:24.220 --> 00:14:25.650
From Haman's Gwadan?

00:14:26.220 --> 00:14:29.150
Yes, they're offering to support
us from the rear!

00:14:29.490 --> 00:14:32.460
So the information was correct.
They are in this area.

00:14:33.320 --> 00:14:34.450
Very well!

00:14:34.530 --> 00:14:37.090
Tell them we appreciate their cooperation!

00:14:37.160 --> 00:14:37.960
Yes, sir!

00:14:39.560 --> 00:14:42.030
Which of our battleships is
closest to the Gwadan?!

00:14:42.100 --> 00:14:43.930
Sir! That would be the Alexandria!

00:14:44.470 --> 00:14:46.400
Captain Gady.

00:14:46.470 --> 00:14:49.300
Have the Alexandria keep a close watch
on the Gwadan!

00:14:49.370 --> 00:14:50.340
Roger!

00:14:51.240 --> 00:14:52.330
That witch.

00:14:52.410 --> 00:14:54.640
Is she trying to sell us a favor?

00:15:16.000 --> 00:15:17.020
Captain Gady!

00:15:17.100 --> 00:15:18.930
The Gwadan has disappeared
behind Gryps 2!

00:15:19.300 --> 00:15:21.360
We cannot confirm their position!

00:15:33.520 --> 00:15:34.980
Aim for this spot.

00:15:35.050 --> 00:15:37.210
Our target is only one of the
nuclear pulse engines.

00:15:38.090 --> 00:15:40.450
We don't have to make it
totally inoperative.

00:15:40.520 --> 00:15:43.890
So when the time comes for us
to use this Colony Laser...!

00:15:44.460 --> 00:15:46.120
You catch on quickly, Captain.

00:15:57.470 --> 00:15:58.130
Behind me?!

00:15:59.980 --> 00:16:00.970
Lieutenant Emma!

00:16:09.450 --> 00:16:11.750
Don't come out unless your suit
is fully prepped!

00:16:19.430 --> 00:16:20.490
Damn you!

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:26.970
Kamille!

00:16:27.740 --> 00:16:29.870
Fa, what's wrong? Fa!

00:16:30.410 --> 00:16:32.030
Fa!

00:16:32.680 --> 00:16:35.240
Nemo 27 has been hit.

00:16:35.310 --> 00:16:37.940
Tell him to retreat! What about
our reserve mobile suits?!

00:16:38.680 --> 00:16:40.340
We have no more pilots!

00:16:41.050 --> 00:16:42.640
I know at least how to move one!

00:16:43.120 --> 00:16:45.110
No. Captain, I'll go.

00:16:46.260 --> 00:16:47.220
But...!

00:16:47.360 --> 00:16:49.290
I won't be reckless.

00:16:49.890 --> 00:16:51.220
Is Kamille okay?!

00:16:51.330 --> 00:16:54.130
Petty Officer Fa!
I thought you were in confinement!

00:16:54.470 --> 00:16:57.090
But I heard you didn't have enough pilots...!

00:16:57.570 --> 00:17:00.800
Captain, please allow me to launch! Please!

00:17:01.470 --> 00:17:04.170
Fa is sensing Kamille.

00:17:04.240 --> 00:17:07.110
Okay, I release you from
confinement! Get out there!

00:17:07.540 --> 00:17:09.100
Y-Yes, sir!

00:17:09.780 --> 00:17:11.540
Katz! You go out, too!

00:17:11.620 --> 00:17:13.170
I almost went out in your place!

00:17:13.880 --> 00:17:16.250
You did, Mr. Torres? That's crazy!

00:17:16.320 --> 00:17:17.980
I can't leave this position!

00:17:18.520 --> 00:17:20.180
I'm on my way!

00:17:21.230 --> 00:17:23.130
Fa! Go get them! Katz! Go get them!

00:17:26.560 --> 00:17:28.090
Shoot them down!

00:17:42.110 --> 00:17:43.700
At this rate...!

00:17:50.750 --> 00:17:51.980
Who is it?!

00:17:52.460 --> 00:17:53.250
Kamille!

00:17:53.690 --> 00:17:55.750
Come on! You can do better!

00:17:56.190 --> 00:17:57.390
Fa! Katz!

00:18:02.730 --> 00:18:04.360
It's almost time.

00:18:04.870 --> 00:18:05.990
Prepare to fire cannons!

00:18:06.070 --> 00:18:08.540
Our target is the Gryps 2
nuclear pulse engine!

00:18:09.040 --> 00:18:09.970
Yes, ma'am!

00:18:10.040 --> 00:18:13.200
Prepare to fire the first, second,
and third main cannons!

00:18:13.710 --> 00:18:15.680
The Gwadan has yet to make a move!

00:18:15.750 --> 00:18:16.870
What's taking them so long?

00:18:17.480 --> 00:18:19.070
We can't wait...

00:18:19.150 --> 00:18:20.550
<i>Haman.</i>

00:18:20.620 --> 00:18:24.350
<i>Is she working on a strategy</i>
<i>to come out of this with the least attrition?</i>

00:18:25.490 --> 00:18:28.390
Just a little longer!
We've got to withstand this!

00:18:28.460 --> 00:18:30.720
Open gun platforms!
Prepare for a ship-to-ship battle!

00:18:32.360 --> 00:18:33.890
My timing!

00:18:39.600 --> 00:18:41.130
Fa! We're outnumbered!

00:18:41.210 --> 00:18:43.610
- Avoid close combat!
- Roger!

00:18:44.710 --> 00:18:48.080
Hasn't the Gwadan made its move yet?
We're not going to last forever!

00:18:50.780 --> 00:18:51.770
Damn Haman!

00:18:52.480 --> 00:18:54.710
Okay, fire main cannons!

00:19:06.800 --> 00:19:08.630
The Gwadan... came through?

00:19:11.640 --> 00:19:15.000
Gryps 2 has incurred a direct hit?!

00:19:15.070 --> 00:19:16.730
We cannot confirm damage!

00:19:16.810 --> 00:19:19.440
It's been hit by a beam shot from
the Gwadan. No mistake about it!

00:19:19.510 --> 00:19:20.480
What?!

00:19:20.880 --> 00:19:22.510
What the hell was the Alexandria doing?!

00:19:23.310 --> 00:19:24.680
The Gwadan's retreating!

00:19:25.050 --> 00:19:27.020
We won't let them get away.

00:19:27.120 --> 00:19:29.850
Retrieve all mobile suits!
We're going after the Gwadan!

00:19:30.350 --> 00:19:31.980
Captain, please calm down!

00:19:32.060 --> 00:19:33.990
We must first focus on defending Gryps 2!

00:19:34.060 --> 00:19:35.750
You have the nerve to lecture me?!

00:19:36.290 --> 00:19:39.790
How am I going to explain this to
His Excellency Jamitov?

00:19:46.640 --> 00:19:49.940
Our main cannons were aimed at
the Argama, right, Captain?!

00:19:50.210 --> 00:19:51.170
Yes, ma'am!

00:19:51.240 --> 00:19:55.080
Our shot aimed at the Argama
went astray, and hit Gryps 2.

00:19:55.150 --> 00:19:56.610
What an unfortunate incident.

00:19:56.680 --> 00:19:59.670
We are now out of the range
of main cannons of the Titans' fleet.

00:20:00.380 --> 00:20:01.320
Captain.

00:20:01.390 --> 00:20:04.320
We will proceed to our rendezvous point
with the Argama.

00:20:04.390 --> 00:20:07.120
- Yes, ma'am!
- I'll leave you in charge.

00:20:10.190 --> 00:20:12.590
Gryps 2's line of fire seems to have shifted.

00:20:13.230 --> 00:20:15.490
There has been a change in
its course to the Moon.

00:20:16.830 --> 00:20:19.330
Haman kept her promise.

00:20:19.900 --> 00:20:21.340
The Argama will now retreat!

00:20:21.410 --> 00:20:23.370
Withdraw mobile suit team!

00:20:39.660 --> 00:20:41.560
Welcome, Char Aznable.

00:20:46.360 --> 00:20:49.060
We thank you for your cooperation,
Miss Mineva.

00:20:50.300 --> 00:20:51.630
Char Aznable.

00:20:51.700 --> 00:20:55.300
I am truly grateful to see that
you have returned.

00:20:55.370 --> 00:20:57.500
I trust that you will continue to
serve me.

00:20:58.380 --> 00:20:59.340
Yes.

00:21:00.340 --> 00:21:01.540
Until the next time.

00:21:02.750 --> 00:21:04.810
The Zabi Family will be
revived shortly.

00:21:04.880 --> 00:21:08.080
Please pray for that day
to be good for us all.

00:21:08.750 --> 00:21:09.720
Yes.

00:21:10.120 --> 00:21:13.520
Miss Mineva. With this, the A.E.U.G.
now belongs to Axis.

00:21:14.390 --> 00:21:17.120
From this point on, they shall work
as your arms and legs...

00:21:17.190 --> 00:21:20.320
...all for the sake of reviving
the Zabi Family.

00:21:20.560 --> 00:21:22.730
And Char made this all possible?

00:21:22.800 --> 00:21:24.770
Yes, of course.

00:21:44.550 --> 00:21:48.250
I'm grateful that we didn't
engage that thing in combat, aren't you?

00:21:48.330 --> 00:21:49.220
Yes.

00:21:49.290 --> 00:21:52.290
But who knows what might happen
in the future.

00:21:58.800 --> 00:22:02.240
- Did you get data on the Gwadan?!
- I'm working on it!

00:22:02.310 --> 00:22:03.800
Don't miss a single turret!

00:22:12.550 --> 00:22:13.520
Lieutenant.

00:22:47.270 --> 00:22:49.600
Oh, I can't help believing you

00:22:50.480 --> 00:22:56.020
kanarazu aeru to ano hi kara shinjiteita

00:22:50.480 --> 00:22:56.020
I've believed we're sure to meet again ever since that day

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:01.400
kitto yobiau kokoro ga areba

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:01.400
If we have heart, we'll be called together again

00:23:01.450 --> 00:23:11.790
mugen no Energy yobisamasu

00:23:01.450 --> 00:23:11.790
Awaken the infinite energy

00:23:11.830 --> 00:23:17.420
aa kizutsukeau mae ni

00:23:11.830 --> 00:23:17.420
Before you get hurt

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:23.510
dekiru koto sagashite Please

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:23.510
Find what you can do...Please

00:23:23.550 --> 00:23:28.680
nagedasanai de kurushii toki koso

00:23:23.550 --> 00:23:28.680
Don't throw it away because of this painful age

00:23:29.390 --> 00:23:32.020
itsuka mita aoi sora wo

00:23:29.390 --> 00:23:32.020
Until the day we gaze up again

00:23:32.030 --> 00:23:39.030
kitto anata to miageru hi made

00:23:32.030 --> 00:23:39.030
at the blue sky we once saw

00:23:46.980 --> 00:23:49.070
Although Haman joined forces
with the A.E.U.G....

00:23:49.150 --> 00:23:50.940
...in her quest to revive the Zabi Family...

00:23:51.010 --> 00:23:53.040
...she decides to meet with Jamitov.

00:23:53.120 --> 00:23:57.610
This is all possible because Haman
possesses a deadly secret weapon.

00:23:58.150 --> 00:24:02.450
During the ensuing operation,
Kamille meets Sarah Zabiarov.

00:24:03.190 --> 00:24:07.530
Next on Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam,
"The Gate of Zedan".

00:24:07.460 --> 00:24:12.440
Next Episode

00:24:07.460 --> 00:24:12.440
The Gate of Zedan

00:24:08.530 --> 00:24:11.170
You will see the tears of time.
